## Known Issues & Fixes

**After composer update → section sites return 500:**
```bash
# Fix vendor permissions
find /home/esn-hungary/htdocs/new-hungary.esn.hu/vendor -type f -exec chmod o+r {} \;
find /home/esn-hungary/htdocs/new-hungary.esn.hu/vendor -type d -exec chmod o+rx {} \;
# Clear caches on all sections
for DOMAIN in new-bme.esn.hu new-corvinus.esn.hu new-debrecen.esn.hu new-elte.esn.hu new-eszterhazy.esn.hu new-ibs.esn.hu mate.esn.hu new-miskolc.esn.hu new-obuda.esn.hu new-pecs.esn.hu semmelweis.esn.hu new-szeged.esn.hu lups.esn.hu; do
  vendor/bin/drush --uri=https://$DOMAIN cr
done
```

**Radix accidentally upgraded to 6.x → 503 on all pages:**
```bash
rm -rf web/themes/contrib/radix
composer require "drupal/radix:^5.0"
vendor/bin/drush --uri=https://new-hungary.esn.hu cr
```

**"core.services.yml is not valid" → 500/503:**
```bash
composer reinstall drupal/core-recommended
vendor/bin/drush --uri=https://new-hungary.esn.hu cr
```

**"@radix/form/input.twig is not defined" → 503:**
Radix is on v6. See Radix fix above.

